# MetaDAVis itself IS part of the build context: the Dockerfile copies it to
# /opt/MetaDAVis. Only its git metadata and editor droppings are excluded - the
# upstream .git directory would otherwise add ~10 MB to the context and make the
# COPY layer invalid every time a clone changes.
MetaDAVis/.git
.git
**/.Rhistory
**/.RData
